{"logId": "78d42258-b36a-43e3-b4dc-81e045e34677", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）", "block_bbox": [319, 121, 888, 165], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[319.0, 121.0], [888.0, 121.0], [888.0, 165.0], [319.0, 165.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "五级【4~5分】：彼此尊重、彼此独立、没有束缚和包袱，各自活好自己阳光的生命。（自由）", "block_bbox": [310, 231, 1439, 264], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[310.0, 231.0], [1439.0, 231.0], [1439.0, 264.0], [310.0, 264.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：父母与子女之间是平等的人格和独立自由的个体，彼此毫无束缚地去过自己的生活，社会的个体属性大于家庭的情感属性。", "block_bbox": [309, 299, 1553, 375], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[309.0, 299.0], [1553.0, 299.0], [1553.0, 375.0], [309.0, 375.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [312, 441, 482, 474], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[312.0, 441.0], [482.0, 441.0], [482.0, 474.0], [312.0, 474.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、享受自己独立和喜欢的生活，不依赖子女", "block_bbox": [337, 500, 860, 532], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 500.0], [860.0, 500.0], [860.0, 532.0], [337.0, 532.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、合理科学地安排好自己生活，不让子女操心", "block_bbox": [336, 544, 884, 574], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 544.0], [884.0, 544.0], [884.0, 574.0], [336.0, 574.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、生病了不傍子女照顾自己，不给子女添麻烦", "block_bbox": [336, 587, 886, 618], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 587.0], [886.0, 587.0], [886.0, 618.0], [336.0, 618.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、能够安排好自己的养老，请保姆照顾自己或找自己中意的养老院", "block_bbox": [337, 630, 1123, 661], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 630.0], [1123.0, 630.0], [1123.0, 661.0], [337.0, 661.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、能够安排好自己的后事，乐观地面对疾病或死亡", "block_bbox": [336, 673, 938, 704], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 673.0], [938.0, 673.0], [938.0, 704.0], [336.0, 704.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、能够引导子女正确面对自己年迈疾病或死亡，不让他们沉浸在悲痛中，乐观阳光地对待", "block_bbox": [336, 716, 1383, 748], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 716.0], [1383.0, 716.0], [1383.0, 748.0], [336.0, 748.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[72]", "block_bbox": [914, 968, 958, 994], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[914.0, 968.0], [957.0, 968.0], [957.0, 993.0], [914.0, 993.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8993769884109497, "coordinate": [319, 121, 888, 165], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[319.0, 121.0], [888.0, 121.0], [888.0, 165.0], [319.0, 165.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8360117673873901, "coordinate": [310, 231, 1439, 264], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[310.0, 231.0], [1439.0, 231.0], [1439.0, 264.0], [310.0, 264.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9301328659057617, "coordinate": [309, 299, 1553, 375], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[309.0, 299.0], [1553.0, 299.0], [1553.0, 375.0], [309.0, 375.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8348674774169922, "coordinate": [312, 441, 482, 474], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[312.0, 441.0], [482.0, 441.0], [482.0, 474.0], [312.0, 474.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8545282483100891, "coordinate": [337, 500, 860, 532], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 500.0], [860.0, 500.0], [860.0, 532.0], [337.0, 532.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8567603826522827, "coordinate": [336, 544, 884, 574], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 544.0], [884.0, 544.0], [884.0, 574.0], [336.0, 574.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8625062108039856, "coordinate": [336, 587, 886, 618], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 587.0], [886.0, 587.0], [886.0, 618.0], [336.0, 618.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.866318941116333, "coordinate": [337, 630, 1123, 661], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 630.0], [1123.0, 630.0], [1123.0, 661.0], [337.0, 661.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.856043815612793, "coordinate": [336, 673, 938, 704], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 673.0], [938.0, 673.0], [938.0, 704.0], [336.0, 704.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8762452602386475, "coordinate": [336, 716, 1383, 748], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 716.0], [1383.0, 716.0], [1383.0, 748.0], [336.0, 748.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.6749786138534546, "coordinate": [914, 968, 958, 994], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[914.0, 968.0], [957.0, 968.0], [957.0, 993.0], [914.0, 993.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）\n\n## 五 级【4~5分】：彼此尊重、彼此独立、没有束缚和包袱，各自活好自己阳光的生命。（自由）\n\n- 本条释义：父母与子女之间是平等的人格和独立自由的个体，彼此毫无束缚地去过自己的生活，社会的个体属性大于家庭的情感属性。\n\n## 符合的行为：\n\n1、享受自己独立和喜欢的生活，不依赖子女\n\n2、合理科学地安排好自己生活，不让子女操心\n\n3、生病了不傍子女照顾自己，不给子女添麻烦\n\n4、能够安排好自己的养老，请保姆照顾自己或找自己中意的养老院\n\n5、能够安排好自己的后事，乐观地面对疾病或死亡\n\n6、能够引导子女正确面对自己年迈疾病或死亡，不让他们沉浸在悲痛中，乐观阳光地对待", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//78d42258-b36a-43e3-b4dc-81e045e34677/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A39%3A01Z%2F-1%2F%2Fac1ff09481e31410e22912773dbaf7496e528d08e6196703926adf55e16890ad"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//78d42258-b36a-43e3-b4dc-81e045e34677/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A39%3A01Z%2F-1%2F%2F05889829d069aa85523f5d4eaab428ff695a214a6881e84ecad8f54e92c1cec3"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//78d42258-b36a-43e3-b4dc-81e045e34677/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A39%3A02Z%2F-1%2F%2F01522249a6da009c3f189994391587c920b095ba04dff79444069bb20cdf6051"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
